=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Mines\">Roshamuul Mines</a> (down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33690,32348,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33690, 32348, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Cistern\">Roshamuul Cistern</a> (down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33666,32271,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33666, 32271, 7)</a>),\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Isles\">Nightmare Isles</a> (Nightmare Teddy quest floor).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA terrorsleep attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>:</b> You will have a hard time with these. They are very resistant to physical and heal frequently. On top of that, they will almost constantly deal heavy damage. Be wary of their debuff which will reduce your melee skills, because they use it often and it adds up. The best strategy to is to keep an eye on your melee skill and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Fierce%20Berserk\">Fierce Berserk</a>, Front Sweep, or <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> when your skill isn't reduced, while challenging them, to prevent them escape on deep red health. The fight will typically last a little while so be careful not to lure more. The best melee element against them is energy, so sanguine razor and soulmaimer work well there.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on February 4, 2025, the patch removed <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a>, it no longer retreats at low health, decreased strength and probability of skill debuff, decreased healing, increased <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">ice sensitivity</a> from 80% to 95% and energy sensitivity from 90% to 105%.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 477 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>10-189</td>\n<td>101.2</td>\n<td class=\"\"